            "id": "build-bond",
            "title": "A bond of two NICs",
            "story": "The server has two NICs, both cabled to the same switch, but each is a single point of failure. Make a bond of them, give the address to the bond, and the server must keep talking to the switch when either NIC is lost.",
            "goal": "The host pings the switch, and survives the loss of either NIC",
            "hint": "A bond is an object of the host. The NICs become its slaves and give up their own addresses: the address belongs to the bond.",
